{"id":"6214ce931b11d9ae","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyEvalRow.md","title":"PolyEvalRow","display":"PolyEvalRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyEvalRow","parameters":["z1923","z1924","z1925"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyEvalRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z1923</span><span>z1924</span><span>z1925</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 类型判断与独立算法。有序参数：<code>z1923</code>、<code>z1924</code>、<code>z1925</code>。</p>\n<p>五分支后序类型综合，包含失败分支；不调用 PolyType。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyEvalRow z1923 z1924 z1925)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists d\n  (exists g\n    (exists t\n      (exists r\n        (and\n          (exists z1928\n            (and (exists z1929 (and (@ Pair t r z1929) (@ Pair g z1929 z1928))) (@ Pair d z1928 z1925)))\n          (and\n            (@ PolyInput d g t)\n            (or\n              (exists z1930\n                (and\n                  (@ TVar z1930 t)\n                  (or\n                    (exists z1931 (and (@ App g z1930 z1931) (@ OK z1931 r)))\n                    (and (not (exists z1931 (@ App g z1930 z1931))) (@ Fail r)))))\n              (or\n                (exists z1931\n                  (exists z1933\n                    (exists z1934\n                      (exists z1935\n                        (and\n                          (@ TLam z1931 z1933 t)\n                          (and\n                            (@ Cons z1931 g z1934)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z1944\n                            (exists z1945\n                            (and\n                            (in z1944 z1924)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1923 z1944 z1945)\n                            (exists z1946\n                            (and (exists z1947 (and (@ Pair z1933 z1935 z1947) (@ Pair z1934 z1947 z1946))) (@ Pair d z1946 z1945)))))))\n                            (or\n                            (exists z1936 (exists z1937 (and (@ OK z1936 z1935) (and (@ TArr z1931 z1936 z1937) (@ OK z1937 r)))))\n                            (and (@ Fail z1935) (@ Fail r))))))))))\n                (or\n                  (exists z1938\n                    (exists z1939\n                      (exists z1940\n                        (exists z1941\n                          (and\n                            (@ TApp z1938 z1939 t)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z1948\n                            (exists z1949\n                            (and\n                            (in z1948 z1924)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1923 z1948 z1949)\n                            (exists z1950\n                            (and (exists z1951 (and (@ Pair z1938 z1940 z1951) (@ Pair g z1951 z1950))) (@ Pair d z1950 z1949)))))))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z1952\n                            (exists z1953\n                            (and\n                            (in z1952 z1924)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1923 z1952 z1953)\n                            (exists z1954\n                            (and (exists z1955 (and (@ Pair z1939 z1941 z1955) (@ Pair g z1955 z1954))) (@ Pair d z1954 z1953)))))))\n                            (or\n                            (exists z1931 (and (@ STGoodApp z1940 z1941 z1931) (@ OK z1931 r)))\n                            (and (not (exists z1931 (@ STGoodApp z1940 z1941 z1931))) (@ Fail r))))))))))\n                  (or\n                    (exists z1933\n                      (exists z1942\n                        (exists z1943\n                          (exists z1935\n                            (and\n                            (@ FTAbs z1933 t)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Succ d z1942)\n                            (and\n                            (@ PolyCtxLift g z1943)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z1956\n                            (exists z1957\n                            (and\n                            (in z1956 z1924)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1923 z1956 z1957)\n                            (exists z1958\n                            (and\n                            (exists z1959 (and (@ Pair z1933 z1935 z1959) (@ Pair z1943 z1959 z1958)))\n                            (@ Pair z1942 z1958 z1957)))))))\n                            (or\n                            (exists z1936 (exists z1937 (and (@ OK z1936 z1935) (and (@ FForall z1936 z1937) (@ OK z1937 r)))))\n                            (and (@ Fail z1935) (@ Fail r)))))))))))\n                    (exists z1933\n                      (exists z1932\n                        (exists z1935\n                          (and\n                            (@ FTInst z1933 z1932 t)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z1960\n                            (exists z1961\n                            (and\n                            (in z1960 z1924)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1923 z1960 z1961)\n                            (exists z1962\n                            (and (exists z1963 (and (@ Pair z1933 z1935 z1963) (@ Pair g z1963 z1962))) (@ Pair d z1962 z1961)))))))\n                            (or\n                            (exists z1931 (and (@ PolyGoodTApp d z1935 z1932 z1931) (@ OK z1931 r)))\n                            (and (not (exists z1931 (@ PolyGoodTApp d z1935 z1932 z1931))) (@ Fail r))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e67b18d4faf06437\" href=\"?note=e67b18d4faf06437\" title=\"ZFC_Cons\">Cons</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4002d1847fb33d0\" href=\"?note=b4002d1847fb33d0\" title=\"ZFC_FForall\">FForall</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1b540c729aaa0e46\" href=\"?note=1b540c729aaa0e46\" title=\"ZFC_FTAbs\">FTAbs</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"acb0218f5d2e90af\" href=\"?note=acb0218f5d2e90af\" title=\"ZFC_FTInst\">FTInst</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"57b7305c7f765988\" href=\"?note=57b7305c7f765988\" title=\"ZFC_Fail\">Fail</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c6f16aed01caed9d\" href=\"?note=c6f16aed01caed9d\" title=\"ZFC_OK\">OK</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"44829a217799408a\" href=\"?note=44829a217799408a\" title=\"ZFC_PolyCtxLift\">PolyCtxLift</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"275a393f15768c53\" href=\"?note=275a393f15768c53\" title=\"ZFC_PolyGoodTApp\">PolyGoodTApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b9c67510cedee3a1\" href=\"?note=b9c67510cedee3a1\" title=\"ZFC_PolyInput\">PolyInput</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"99369f9c3eb49b63\" href=\"?note=99369f9c3eb49b63\" title=\"ZFC_STGoodApp\">STGoodApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a>；<a class=\"wik